    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.mp4?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slimenator, pick your hero (or at least someone brave enough) and take on hordes of slimes ready to turn your adventure into a sticky mess. Make strategic choices as you progress through challenging stages, adapting to new dangers and opportunities. Every run is unique, filled with surprises and chances to prove you\u2019re more than just a snack for the monsters. Are you ready to crush the slimes and emerge as the true champion?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique characters to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of magic abilities, weapons and accessories.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you embark on a new adventure, the map layout changes, offering fresh challenges at every turn. Encounter different bosses on your journey. No two runs are the same, making each playthrough a new and exciting experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events across the map that can help or harm you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of challenges (siege, deathmatch, waves, etc...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has a unique skill tree!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of slimes!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/5240e377da2d0773f1cb28dfa2ec0397.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/5240e377da2d0773f1cb28dfa2ec0397.apng?t=1748915450\" class=\"bb_img\" width=66 height=18 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.mp4?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you survive?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/aa873bb4021cb3accebb7cf0e9963279.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/aa873bb4021cb3accebb7cf0e9963279.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/f13089a8239d421ea1ddb18cc31d5c15.mp4?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slimenator, pick your hero (or at least someone brave enough) and take on hordes of slimes ready to turn your adventure into a sticky mess. Make strategic choices as you progress through challenging stages, adapting to new dangers and opportunities. Every run is unique, filled with surprises and chances to prove you\u2019re more than just a snack for the monsters. Are you ready to crush the slimes and emerge as the true champion?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique characters to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of magic abilities, weapons and accessories.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you embark on a new adventure, the map layout changes, offering fresh challenges at every turn. Encounter different bosses on your journey. No two runs are the same, making each playthrough a new and exciting experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events across the map that can help or harm you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of challenges (siege, deathmatch, waves, etc...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has a unique skill tree!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of slimes!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/5240e377da2d0773f1cb28dfa2ec0397.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/5240e377da2d0773f1cb28dfa2ec0397.apng?t=1748915450\" class=\"bb_img\" width=66 height=18 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/2954a87016bf7e6b3a8daa7162d8f7ac.mp4?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you survive?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/aa873bb4021cb3accebb7cf0e9963279.poster.avif?t=1748915450\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331810/extras/aa873bb4021cb3accebb7cf0e9963279.webm?t=1748915450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Slimenator is a roguelite where you battle endless waves of slimes trying to overtake the world! Choose and customize up to six powerful skills, along with rare relics and accessories, as you craft the ultimate build to survive the slime apocalypse and outlast the ever-growing swarm!",
